      "writtenOn": "2017-01-24T01:20:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does this trace on every packet transmitted? If so, is there a performance impact?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 45,
        "startChar": 61,
        "endLine": 45,
        "endChar": 73
      },
      "revId": "5d682b1a5181fdf666fe98642a012965f1f53856",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "13075b10_4857c34d",
        "filename": "service/wifi-events.rc",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 45,
      "author": {
        "id": 1081399
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-01-25T03:08:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Indeed, this traces every TX packet on wlan0. To mitigate the performance impact, we\u0027ll stop tracing when we determine that the connection has succeeded or failed. (And, to deal with the cases where we lose track of a connection, we\u0027ll time out tracing on a connection attempt after a certain amount of time.)",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 45,
        "startChar": 61,
        "endLine": 45,
        "endChar": 73
      },
      "revId": "5d682b1a5181fdf666fe98642a012965f1f53856",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e828cac7_8de76592",
        "filename": "service/wifi-events.rc",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 58,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-01-24T01:20:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this changed often at runtime (e.g., when wifi connects/disconnects), or is it set on boot/startup? If on boot/startup, then can it change before the directory is created, fail because the file does not yet exist, and then never be updated again?",
      "range": {
